  "instructions": [
    "Heat binchotan charcoal in a smoky charcoal grill to 225\u001238 F.",
    "Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil and cook farfalle pasta according to package instructions.",
    "Sauté diced onion and minced garlic in olive oil until softened.",
    "Add diced plantain and sweet potato to the skillet and cook until tender.",
    "Add ground cumin, smoked paprika, salt, and black pepper to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Add veggie broth to the skillet and bring to a simmer.",
    "Add cooked farfalle pasta to the skillet and toss to combine.",
    "Transfer the pasta mixture to a serving dish and top with grated cheddar cheese and a dollop of sour cream.",
    "Place the serving dish over the smoky charcoal grill to aerate the dish for 5-7 minutes, or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
  ],
